Ooop spoiling it with the puns already but
yeah we have a lot to talk about.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:34.970
Now the episode opens with Everett Ross meeting
a crazy conspiracy theorist named Agent Prescod.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.870
Finding out that he has damning evidence of
the Skrulls plans Prescod lashes out at him

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.610
which is when he's killed by the character.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:47.050
Ross runs off into the night pursued by a
shadowy figure and it's from this point that

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.620
it all hits the fans.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:54.789
Falling to his death it's revealed that he's
a skrull and chances are that this completely

00:00:54.789 --> 00:00:58.569
blew your mind.

00:00:58.569 --> 00:00:59.569
-

00:00:59.569 --> 00:01:00.569
Now I used to be like you.

00:01:00.569 --> 00:01:05.270
Not a chump but still someone who didn't know
what was going on but the more Ive thought

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:11.549
about it the more it's became clear.

00:01:11.549 --> 00:01:15.320
Everyone is asking if he's been a skrull the
whole time but there's actually a lot of clues

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.210
that that isn't the case.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.189
Now in order to talk about this I have to
go into the Skrull immitation ritual that

00:01:21.189 --> 00:01:23.640
we see being carried at during the first episode.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:27.450
This happens in the restricted area of the
power plant in which we see a warrior copying

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.689
one of the anti-Russian Americans.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:34.580
Now in order to immitate someone a skrull
has to at first see them and this then allows

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:36.149
them duplicate their look.

00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:39.930
This was first shown in Captain Marvel when
Talos and his forces showed up on the beach.

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:44.299
Two of them looked over and then mimicked
a surfer and they had to see her in order

00:01:44.299 --> 00:01:48.000
to do this.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.520
It's the same with the soldier here and thus
Skrulls have to see someone so that they can

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:53.740
become a copy.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:58.189
This just gives them a frame of reference
and it's like when you're an artist and you

00:01:58.189 --> 00:01:59.649
use something to base your own work off.

00:01:59.649 --> 00:02:03.799
So Ross at some point would've had to have
been a real person so that the Skrull could

00:02:03.799 --> 00:02:05.640
copy them in the first place.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:10.810
Sure they could've grown up as him but at
some point they'd have to work their way through

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.800
the security sector in order to get to the
top.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:18.410
It's far easier to copy someone whos already
in that position instead of playing that person

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.750
since birth so you can then get into it.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.530
Now Ross would be the perfect target for a
Skrull to immitate as well and it means that

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:27.709
they could just take a short cut when they
were copying his look.

00:02:27.709 --> 00:02:33.110
Firstly he was high up in American security
and also married to Val who herself's a big

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.110
name too.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:38.830
Add to this the fact that he also had an in
with Wakanda and this would make him an extremely

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.220
valuable target.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.970
This is a guy who has his hand in two of the
most powerful countries on earth and thus

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.409
I think they sought him out rather than a
skrull always being him.

00:02:47.409 --> 00:02:51.959
Now Ross has also done something recently
that makes him a very valuable asset.

00:02:51.959 --> 00:02:57.200
Caught giving secrets to Wakanda he was arrested
by Val and carted off to prison.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:03.290
At this point he was then freed by Okoye and
it's from here that he likely had to lie low.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:07.549
Now this would provide the skrulls with the
perfect opportunity to grab him as he's in

00:03:07.549 --> 00:03:10.910
a very vunerable position and left out there
on his own.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:15.510
He can't turn to the CIA because they're after
him now and thus he couldn't go to them for

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.520
help if he found out he'd been copied.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:22.430
He can however turn to shield but its unlikely
that he would because like I said he's just

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.709
been sprung from jail.

00:03:23.709 --> 00:03:28.220
However a Skrull wouldnt have any qualms about
this and they may have captured him and then

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.100
took him into the plant.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:34.200
Copying him from this point is the perfect
point to take over and this is something that

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.200
we've seen happen in the comics.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.950
The Skrulls tended to mimic someone when they
were completely on their own at a point where

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.870
they could be swapped out without anyone noticing.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.860
They couldve seen that Ross was struggling
on his own and theres plenty of opportunity

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.689
with where we last left him.

00:03:48.689 --> 00:03:53.120
No one of the big weaknesses of the skrulls
is that theyre not perfect copies and they

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.409
often get sniffed out because of their poor
personalities.

00:03:56.409 --> 00:04:01.550
Not slagging you guys off yeah...I'm sure...I'm
sure youre really nice but it's something

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.550
that's happened to them throughout the comics
and movies.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:09.570
Skrulls had difficulty copying mannerisms
and under interrogation they didn't hold up.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:14.819
For example we see in Captain Marvel how Talos
uses the wrong name with Nick and also tries

00:04:14.819 --> 00:04:18.370
to bluff his way through conversations about
their shared history.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.600
This is something that often alerted the heroes
in the comics as Skrulls couldnt really copy

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.470
someone down to that level.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:29.410
Now I will talk about the machine they have
in the show but I doubt that a Skrull wouldve

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:34.190
copied Ross back when he was giving Val his
own invasion in secret.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.190
What?

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:39.510
Now Val like Fury is someone who has very
few friends and she's immediately suspicious

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:40.860
of everyone she meets.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.500
In the comics a Skrull actually took on the
form of Val and she and Fury ended up spending

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.500
a romantic night together.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:53.832
The next day Fury was incredibly suspicious
and he followed her out when she said she

00:04:53.832 --> 00:04:55.330
was getting breakfast.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.820
This took him to an alleyway where she saw
her meeting a contact and he instantly realised

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.100
that something was off.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:05.509
Back at their room he then shot and killed
her which is when it was revealed that she

00:05:05.509 --> 00:05:06.750
was a Skrull.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:12.360
Now Val is exactly the same as Fury in that
she doesnt trust anyone.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:19.280
Thus i think becoming Ross would be the wrong
thing to do if they were in a relationship.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:23.750
She'd probably sniff him out and realise that
something was off and would likely be aware

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.550
of Skrulls anyway because of her security
clearance.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:30.740
So I cant see a Skrull immitating him then
and I think at the very least they'd wait

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.870
until the pair divorced.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:36.500
We also don't know what kinds of mutants there
are knocking about in the MCU and in the comics

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.210
these could easily catch Skrulls out as well.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:43.419
Wolverine has a heightened sense of smell
so he could tell if someone was faking it

00:05:43.419 --> 00:05:47.130
and Professor X could read minds and deduce
it from that as well.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:51.970
Now again Wakanda is a highly advanced civilsation
too and they probably have the tech to sniff

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.610
out foreign entities.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:58.330
Shuri of course operated on Ross after he
got shot and it's likely she'd discover he

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.340
was a skrull during this time.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:04.500
So it has to have happened after that in order
for things to work and thus Ross couldn't

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.590
have been one as recently as that.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.150
Now I personally think that he was likely
grabbed after escaping the van as he probably

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.330
tried to make his way out of the US.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.169
Wanted in the country he may have done an
Edward Snowden which wouldve probbaly taken

00:06:17.169 --> 00:06:19.000
him all the way to Russia.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.850
This would allow the Skrulls the perfect chance
to grab him and they could then take over

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.880
as him and go and work with Shield.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:29.509
Now the memory machines have also had some
upgrades too and we see them possessing far

00:06:29.509 --> 00:06:31.039
more power than what they've had before.

00:06:31.039 --> 00:06:34.660
They can now hold someone in place and the
Skrulls can pull all of their memories out

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.389
which will help them fake people better when
it comes to these kinds of Agents.

00:06:38.389 --> 00:06:42.949
I doubt Hill wouldve just let him in the organisation
and he probably had to pass some tests to

00:06:42.949 --> 00:06:44.290
at least prove that it was him.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:48.430
Having these memories though allowed for him
to work his way in and this is why she seems

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:51.070
so shocked when she sees him on the ground.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:55.111
She genuinely believed that this was actually
Everett Ross and I was surprised that her

00:06:55.111 --> 00:06:57.700
and Fury didnt talk about it at some point.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:01.979
Potentially theyre all just as confused as
we are but it was a weird omission to not

00:07:01.979 --> 00:07:03.270
have it brought up.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:07.310
Now the reason I think it wasn't is because
theyre not that alarmed because they dont

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.970
think that he's been a skrull this entire
time.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:14.480
Talos probably filled them in and it means
that Ross is out there and likely still under

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:15.840
the capture of the Skrulls.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:20.099
Now I do think that at some point we will
see him come back and he's probably someone

00:07:20.099 --> 00:07:21.790
they'll rescure later on in the show.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.580
Makes sense to have some characters we care
about being held captive by the skrulls as

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.100
itll add more emotion to the rescue scene
when they finally free them all.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:33.259
So in the end I think that the Skrulls became
aware of Agent Prescod and thus they sent

00:07:33.259 --> 00:07:35.789
someone in who could find out what was going
on.

00:07:35.789 --> 00:07:40.190
Ross seemed like the best fit and thus he
was then chosen and this is when Talos got

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.400
wise to their plan.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:44.460
At least that's what I think when we talk
about this reveal.

